From 24556e87108d29bda9b8757c011224f209420176 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel <aloziefrompg@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 19:42:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix unsubscribed page, add scheduled campaigns and clickable
 images

- Unsubscribed page: Mailchimp requests time out, are read in parallel, and the page shows real errors with a history fallback.
- Scheduled campaigns: send at a chosen time without anyone logged in (table, API, cron route, schedule UI, cancel).
- Campaign sending moved into src/lib/campaignRun.ts so manual and scheduled sends share one code path.
- Clickable images in the email body: [image: URL | LINK | DESCRIPTION] with a toolbar panel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LHbnzt849egZ8yN5Kkk57L
